003.steps:
1. Profile Objects-DNS Filtering, add a profile named "test", the action of category "Gaming" is Forged IP reply;
2. Rules and Policies-DNS Rules, enable a DNS Policy : Action-Filter, Interface-X0, Profile-"test";
3. Security Service-DNS Security-DNS Filtering, set a valid Forged IPv4 address 10.0.0.1;
4. PC connected to X0, set dns server as X0 IP, do 'dig www.ea.com -t A', check the result.

